### Prompt 5

How can I draw straight lines accurately between two points?

### Response 5

Use Bresenham's Line Drawing Algorithm. It is commonly used in computer graphics because it efficiently determines which points should be plotted to form a straight line.

Suggested function:

```c
void draw_line(int x1, int y1,
               int x2, int y2,
               char ch);
```

This algorithm uses integer calculations and works well on a character-based grid.

