### Prompt 6

How can triangles be drawn?

### Response 6

A triangle can be created by drawing three lines that connect three vertices.

Example:

```c
draw_line(x1,y1,x2,y2,ch);
draw_line(x2,y2,x3,y3,ch);
draw_line(x3,y3,x1,y1,ch);
```

Wrap these statements inside a dedicated triangle function.

